{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"didFetchItemsFromStore"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"didFetchItemsFromStore","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"didFetchItemsFromStore","symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"STV"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)SCModelActions(py)didFetchItemsFromStore"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCModelActions"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Action gets called as soon as the model has retrieved its items from their data store.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCModelActions\/didFetchItemsFromStore"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"copy"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:SCModelActions.h@T@SCDidFetchModelItemsAction_Block","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCDidFetchModelItemsAction_Block","text":"SCDidFetchModelItemsAction_Block"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"didFetchItemsFromStore"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This action is typically used to customize the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"items"},{"type":"text","text":" array after it has been fetched from the data store. Items can be added, removed, or rearranged. The added items can either be objects that are suppored by the data store, or normal SCTableViewCell (or subclass) objects."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Example:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ Objective-C","modelActions.didFetchItemsFromStore = ^(SCArrayOfItemsModel *itemsModel, NSMutableArray *items)","{","    \/\/ Add a button cell at the end of the fetched items list","    SCTableViewCell *buttonCell = [SCTableViewCell cellWithText:@\"Tap me!\" textAlignment:NSTextAlignmentCenter];","    buttonCell.cellActions.didSelect = ^(SCTableViewCell *cell, NSIndexPath *indexPath)","    {","        NSLog(@\"buttonCell tapped!\");","    };","","    [items addObject:buttonCell];","};"],"syntax":"objective-c","type":"codeListing"},{"style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This action is only applicable to SCArrayOfItemsModel subclasses, such as SCArrayOfObjectsModel.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside"}]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/stv\/scmodelactions\/didfetchitemsfromstore"]}],"references":{"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCModelActions":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCModelActions","type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"This class hosts a set of model action blocks. Once an action is set to a desired code block, it will execute the block as soon as the action occurs.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scmodelactions","kind":"symbol","title":"SCModelActions","fragments":[{"text":"SCModelActions","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCModelActions/didFetchItemsFromStore":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCModelActions\/didFetchItemsFromStore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Action gets called as soon as the model has retrieved its items from their data store."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scmodelactions\/didfetchitemsfromstore","fragments":[{"text":"didFetchItemsFromStore","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"didFetchItemsFromStore"},"doc